{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_136_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_136","textTraditional":"一、四年，春，宋公使華元來聘。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_136_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_136","textTraditional":"二、三月壬申，鄭伯堅卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_136_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_136","textTraditional":"三、〈木巳〉伯來朝。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_136_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_136","textTraditional":"四、夏四月甲寅，臧孫許卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_136_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_136","textTraditional":"五、公如晉。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_136_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_136","textTraditional":"六、葬鄭襄公。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_136_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_136","textTraditional":"七、秋，公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_136_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_136","textTraditional":"八、冬，城運。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_136_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_136","textTraditional":"九、鄭伯伐許。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}